<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png"/><title>Update on Minneapolis Fed Ending Too Big to Fail Initiative | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis</title><meta name="title" content="Update on Minneapolis Fed Ending Too Big to Fail Initiative | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="description" content="&lt;p&gt;Remarks given at the Minnesota Chamber of Commerce in Minneapolis, MN.&lt;/p&gt;"/><meta name="content centers" content="From the President"/><meta name="ess:pagetype" content="Speech"/><meta name="ess:contentcenter" content="From the President"/><meta name="ess:publishdatetime" content="2016-04-18T05:00:00Z"/><meta name="sortDate" content="2016-04-18T05:00:00Z"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="/speeches/2016/update-on-minneapolis-fed-ending-too-big-to-fail-initiative"/><meta property="og:title" content="Update on Minneapolis Fed Ending Too Big to Fail Initiative | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="og:description" content="&lt;p&gt;Remarks given at the Minnesota Chamber of Commerce in Minneapolis, MN.&lt;/p&gt;"/><meta property="og:image" content="/-/media/images/president/kashkari-neel/2015-11-10/kashkari-neel-2015-11-optc.jpg?rev=3fdac211c52449ffad4d7313f7f658ea"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Update on Minneapolis Fed Ending Too Big to Fail Initiative | Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="&lt;p&gt;Remarks given at the Minnesota Chamber of Commerce in Minneapolis, MN.&lt;/p&gt;"/><meta name="twitter:url" content="/speeches/2016/update-on-minneapolis-fed-ending-too-big-to-fail-initiative"/><meta name="twitter:image" content="/-/media/images/president/kashkari-neel/2015-11-10/kashkari-neel-2015-11-optc.jpg?rev=3fdac211c52449ffad4d7313f7f658ea?sc_lang=en"/><meta name="next-head-count" content="21"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/ba589f78dbc8687a-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5f5027ccbe3e5871-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/e77288c387d37b79-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/5db7d341bde4960f-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/fc36caba970e3f79-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/56d8a1c2c4f9ae43-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/a09404883fbfd53c-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/504d972807344a18-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/cbb8a7defadc46de-s.p.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous" data-next-font="size-adjust"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/css/4f1aae181a6905f3.css" as="style"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/4f1aae181a6905f3.css" data-n-g=""/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/css/706e79a094b4a8e8.css" as="style"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/706e79a094b4a8e8.css" data-n-p=""/><noscript data-n-css=""></noscript><script defer="" nomodule="" src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js"></script><script src="/js/libs/jquery-3.7.1.min.js" defer="" data-nscript="beforeInteractive"></